<title>POLAND: BOS MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 6.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>BOS MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 6.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit					  6.86 vs    1.49</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   12.92 vs    3.64</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 18.28 vs    6.24</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	22.55 vs   19.76</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit					 21.47 vs    8.93</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   30.54 vs   16.83</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 44.83 vs   24.68</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	57.92 vs   55.88</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Ochrony Srodowiska</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
